#: app/Services/FormBuilder/ElementCustomization.php:118
msgid "Tells the browser what kind of information this field collects so it can be autofilled, and lets assistive technology identify the input purpose (WCAG 1.3.5). Choose \"off\" to disable browser autofill, or \"None\" to add no attribute at all. You can also type a scoped value such as \"billing postal-code\". Anything outside the HTML autofill list is ignored when the form is displayed."
msgstr "Tells the browser what kind of information this field collects so it can be autofilled, and lets assistive technology identify the input purpose (WCAG 1.3.5). Choose \"off\" to disable browser autofill, or \"None\" to add no attribute at all. You can also type a scoped value such as \"billing postal-code\". Anything outside the HTML autofill list is ignored when the form is displayed."

